WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.830
Okay, I need to tighten what I'm gonna say.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:12.020
America's leadership in the 21st Century is
not a choice between ignoring the rest of

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:19.250
the world, except when we kill terrorists,
or occupying and rebuilding whatever society

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:22.230
is unraveling.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.409
Leadership means a wise application of military
power.

00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:32.599
The problem for Barack Obama is that he says
our policy shouldn't be about killing terrorists,

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.530
it should be about more.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.820
But that's all policy has been over his tenure.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.660
Sure, we killed Osama bin Laden, but look
who's in power in Syria.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.650
Look who's taking over parts of Iraq.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.280
The President is exactly right.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:53.740
Leadership does mean a wise application of
military power, but it also means resourcing

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.590
that military power.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.680
It means leadership when Russia invades the
Ukraine.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.430
It means leadership when American soldiers
and sailors are taken prisoner by Iran.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.000
It means leadership against terrorism.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.750
It means fighting against tyrannies the world
over because otherwise they come to our shores.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:20.180
And that's the challenge that the next president
faces, is that we haven't pushed back on China,

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:25.060
we haven't pushed back on Russia, we haven't
pushed back on anyone.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:29.320
What do you think about President Obama's
legacy?

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.450
Let us know in the comments section.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:36.280
Don't miss my colleagues responding to the
President's State of the Union in these other

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:36.720
videos.

